# brain merge-driver (packages/brain/docs/merge-driver.md): the CHANGELOGs union their sections, a net for a merge
# back from release/X.Y; a PR writes a fragment (packages/brain/changes/, changes/), never the CHANGELOG itself.
CHANGELOG.md merge=brain
packages/brain/CHANGELOG.md merge=brain
# docs/reference/ is brain reference's public render: a view, one side kept, then rendered again.
docs/reference/**/*.md merge=brain
